# Build context for `gcloud run deploy --source .`
#
# This file exists for one specific reason. Without it, gcloud falls back to
# .gitignore to decide what to upload -- and .gitignore excludes
# `app/artifacts/*.joblib`, which is exactly the model the container needs. The
# build would succeed and the container would then crash on startup looking for a
# file that was never uploaded. Keeping this file means the artifact ships.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
notebooks/
tests/
data/
results/
figures/
sql/
*.md
requirements.txt

# NOT ignored, deliberately: app/artifacts/ -- the serving model lives there.
